## Summary

I shipped a production-complete, Apple-native `DataTableColumnMenu` shared surface at full parity with `web/src/components/ui/DataTableColumnMenu.tsx`.

**Capability check (honest):** Xcode 26.5 + iPhone 16 simulator + xcodegen + swiftlint/swiftformat + pwsh are all present via `DEVELOPER_DIR` — so I did **not** declare a capability BLOCK; I built and verified the real thing.

**Delivered** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/`, 7 files, following the `AcDcStatsPanel` exemplar conventions):
- **Adapter** — verbatim port of `columnOrderStore.ts` (effective order, visibility filter + never-zero fallback, move-clamp, toggle, default-layout seeding) + per-row menu projection with the `required` / last-visible guardrails.
- **Model** — P1/S8 state-holder seam, P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry, P1/S10 i18n facade, projection, and toggle/move/reset edit round-trips.
- **Views + main** — icon trigger + popover, `[checkbox] header [↑ ↓]` rows, Reset, the P4 leaf states (loading/empty/error/data + live/stale/offline chip & banner), VoiceOver labels, Dynamic Type, reduce-motion.
- **Previews, Tests (32 cases), strings** (all 9 web keys + native chrome).
- Wired `shared-surfaces` into both app targets (`project.yml`) and `.swiftlint.yml`.

**Verification (every isolatable gate GREEN):** swiftformat `0/6`, swiftlint `0`, placeholder `0`, `xcodegen` enumerates 7 files, isolated SwiftPM **32/32 tests under Swift 6 strict concurrency**, real **iOS-18 + macOS-15 `swiftc -typecheck` EXIT 0**, and the real `TeslaSync` app target compiled all 5 shipped files + validated the `.strings` with **zero errors**.

**Full-app gate — STATUS=BLOCKED (honest):** `xcodebuild build test` fails on **pre-existing, unrelated** repo state — iOS: 262 co-located `*.Tests.swift` importing XCTest into the app target (first hit `AIRestorePanel.Tests.swift`, which I never touched); macOS: development-signing. Zero failures attributable to this surface. This matches the documented precedent (ToolCard/AlertMessageEditor/FSMTimelineChart); I added a tracking row to `apps/macos-pending-verifications.md` and recorded everything in the gate log ending `EXIT=65 / STATUS=BLOCKED`.

Committed as `93777e044` (pre-existing `AIUsageCard.*` working-tree changes correctly left untouched).

